AERIS Alembic migrations.

Fresh database (CI, new dev box):
    alembic upgrade head

Existing dev database (already has data_points + data_sources from earlier
create_all bootstrap): stamp it as current so the initial migration's
CREATE TABLE statements are not re-run, then upgrade normally afterwards:
    alembic stamp head
    # future migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

The connection URL comes from app.config.settings.database_url_sync.
Tests override it by calling Config.set_main_option("sqlalchemy.url", ...)
before invoking alembic.command — env.py only falls back to settings when
no URL is set on the Config object.
